## Building APK

# Install EAS CLI (one time)
npm install -g eas-cli

# Login to Expo
eas login

# Build APK locally
eas build --platform android --profile preview --local

# Install on device
adb install build-*.apk

eas secret:create --scope project --name EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENAI_API_KEY --value "sk-proj-your-actual-key-here"
